 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Memory Efficiency:** The method achieves significant memory savings. In the Dining Room scene, it uses 4.8 MB compared to 6.5 MB for a dense mesh with no LOD and 4.2 MB for a sparse mesh with no LOD. It achieves over a 5× reduction in memory overhead compared to state-of-the-art methods while maintaining comparable image quality [S1, unofficial].
